  "content": "\n\n<p>如果您想将此模组加入您的整合包，欢迎随意使用 :)</p>\n<p>此模组允许在聊天栏中分享来自 JEI 的配方。<br>\n如果您在寻找 EMI 的等价模组，请参阅 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-recipe-sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Recipe Sharing (EMIRS)</a></p>\n<p>只需打开 JEI 界面并点击新的分享按钮即可分享任意配方：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1626/768/screenshot-2026-04-11-193906-png.png\" alt=\"分享按钮的位置\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1626/756/screenshot-2026-04-11-193025-png.png\" alt=\"聊天栏中的已分享配方\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
